  "solution": "Checking each option one by one:\n\nGiven equation: 18 * 12 * 4 * 5 * 6 = 53\n\n1) +, -, ×, ÷\n\n18 + 12 - 4 × 5 ÷ 6\n\n= 18 + 12 - 4 × 0.833\n\n= 18 + 12 - 3.33\n\n= 26.67 ≠ 53\n\n2) ×, -, ÷, +\n\n18 × 12 - 4 ÷ 5 + 6\n\n= 18 × 12 - 0.8 + 6\n\n= 216 - 0.8 + 6\n\n= 221.2 ≠ 53\n\n**3) ×, ÷, +, -**\n\n**18 × 12 ÷ 4 + 5 - 6**\n\n**= 18 × 3 + 5 - 6**\n\n**= 54 + 5 - 6**\n\n**= 53 = 53**\n\n4) ×, +, ÷, -\n\n18 × 12 + 4 ÷ 5 - 6\n\n= 18 × 12 + 0.8 - 6\n\n= 216 + 0.8 - 6\n\n= 210.8 ≠ 53\n\nHence, **\"×, ÷, +, -\"** is the correct answer.",
